    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "Generate engaging Instagram content about the Caribbean islands in Boca del Toro, Panama. Focus on one specific aspect from this list: pristine beaches, crystal clear waters, tropical wildlife, Ngäbe indigenous culture, sustainable tourism, water sports, coral reefs, mangrove forests, or local cuisine.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "You are a travel content creator specializing in Caribbean destinations. Create engaging Instagram content about the beautiful Caribbean islands in Boca del Toro, Panama.\n\nContent should include:\n- Captivating description of one specific attraction or experience\n- 2-3 relevant hashtags including #BocaDelToro #CaribbeanParadise #Panama\n- A call to action encouraging engagement\n- Keep it under 150 words\n- Use emojis appropriately\n- Focus on authentic, sustainable tourism\n\nTopics to rotate through:\n- Pristine beaches and crystal clear waters\n- Tropical wildlife (sloths, red frogs, dolphins)\n- Ngäbe indigenous culture and traditions\n- Sustainable eco-tourism activities\n- Water sports (surfing, snorkeling, kayaking)\n- Vibrant coral reefs and marine life\n- Lush mangrove forests\n- Local Caribbean cuisine and flavors\n- Hidden gems and secret spots\n- Conservation efforts\n\nGenerate content that inspires wanderlust while promoting responsible tourism."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "content-generator",
      "name": "Caribbean Content Generator",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "position": [
        224,
